        "username": "TheChad",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thechad/{size}/5095_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-01-20T16:32:20.948Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m playing my first of these weekly challenges and I’m new to Season 2 so forgive me if I’ve missed something.</p>\n<p>The text of Infinitor’ “Whispers of Oblivion” reads:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Infinitor deals each target 1 psychic damage.  If at least one target is destroyed this way, restore all manifestation cards to their maximum HP<br>\nPlay the top card of the villain deck.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>It should work from the top of the card down, resolving each action as it goes right?<br>\nI’m seeing it appraise the IF condition in the second sentence first.<br>\nApply the result (heal all five Manifestations from 1 to 4 HP) and THEN the damage screen pops up and deals them all 1 damage (well 1 + 1)</p>\n<p>It should have been a game win as soon as the first line is actioned.</p>\n<p>Cheers</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-01-20T16:34:26.058Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 15,
        "reads": 35,
        "readers_count": 34,
        "score": 82.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 29043,
        "topic_slug": "infinitor-whispers-of-oblivion",
        "display_username": "Chad",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
