        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I’m playing my first of these weekly challenges and I’m new to Season 2 so forgive me if I’ve missed something.\n\nThe text of Infinitor' \"Whispers of Oblivion\" reads:\n\n> Infinitor deals each target 1 psychic damage.  If at least one target is destroyed this way, restore all manifestation cards to their maximum HP\n> Play the top card of the villain deck.\n\nIt should work from the top of the card down, resolving each action as it goes right? \nI’m seeing it appraise the IF condition in the second sentence first. \nApply the result (heal all five Manifestations from 1 to 4 HP) and THEN the damage screen pops up and deals them all 1 damage (well 1 + 1)  \n\nIt should have been a game win as soon as the first line is actioned.\n\nCheers",
