        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I would have read the card the same way as you, but this is how the game tends to read it. Whispers of Oblivion hits each target one at a time. As soon as hitting a target destroys it, the healing effect triggers and heals all the Manifestations.\n\nIf you're up against Heroic Infinitor, him placing Manifestations under himself doesn't count as destroying them, so what probably happened was that it hit and destroyed a hero target and healed all the Manifestations. You can avoid that by controlling the order in which Infinitor hits things. \n\nIf it healed everything before hitting anything, that's a bug and should be reported.",
