        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thechad/{size}/5095_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-01-21T18:21:05.010Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the feedback - I appreciate your time. I’ve just worked out my issue. I’ve only been playing the basic rules so I never read the Advanced text on the villains.<br>\nThe Challenge text on the Infinitor card reads:</p>\n<p>AT THE START OF THE VILLAIN TURN, THE TOP CARD OF INFINITOR’S DECK IS REVEALED.<br>\nIF IT IS A MANIFESTATION, IT IS PUT INTO PLAY.<br>\nIF NOT, IT IS SHUFFLED BACK INTO INFINITOR’S DECK AND EACH MANIFESTATION IN PLAY IS RESTORED TO ITS MAXIMUM HP.</p>\n<p>So basically it was an identical but totally unrelated effect healing the Manifestations.</p>\n<p>The last possible second to prevent my win was the first time it came up in the game <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/joy.png?v=10\" title=\":joy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":joy:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-01-21T18:21:05.010Z",
