        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Thanks for the feedback - I appreciate your time. I’ve just worked out my issue. I’ve only been playing the basic rules so I never read the Advanced text on the villains. \nThe Challenge text on the Infinitor card reads:\n\nAT THE START OF THE VILLAIN TURN, THE TOP CARD OF INFINITOR'S DECK IS REVEALED. \nIF IT IS A MANIFESTATION, IT IS PUT INTO PLAY.\nIF NOT, IT IS SHUFFLED BACK INTO INFINITOR'S DECK AND EACH MANIFESTATION IN PLAY IS RESTORED TO ITS MAXIMUM HP.\n\nSo basically it was an identical but totally unrelated effect healing the Manifestations.\n\nThe last possible second to prevent my win was the first time it came up in the game 😂",
